# Backend Rules

- The AI Agent (`src/agent/`) must never directly call the payment service (`src/mock_payment/`).
- All financial execution routes through the Safety Gateway (`src/gateway/`).
- Database logic belongs strictly in `src/database/models.py` and gateway service engines.
- Write proposals, validation decisions, and attempts to durable storage before any external network call.
- Derive provider idempotency keys from `intent_id` (`idem_{intent_id}`) to defeat restart duplicates.
- Handle timeouts (`UNKNOWN`) via active reconciliation before permitting retries.
